  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_gamma_utils/rc_gamma_utils_title.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>简单且干净的Gamma Mod，适用于所有Mod加载器，无需任何花哨的设置。</h2>\n<h3>功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>按 <code>H</code> 键激活全屏亮度</li>\n<li>按键绑定可配置</li>\n<li>当安装了Iris Shader且Shader激活时，启用夜视而非全Gamma</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_gamma_utils/resource_gamma_util_example.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
